# Rover-side only. The command server never loads a detector, so the PyTorch weights and
# the perception dependency set stay out of the build context and out of the image.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash on purpose: dashboard/models/ holds the ONNX copies the
# browser bench downloads, and those must ship. An unanchored `models/` is read as the
# top-level directory only, but the slash says so out loud rather than relying on it.
/models/
requirements-perception.txt

# The suite runs in CI and on a developer machine, never inside the served container.
tests/
pytest.ini
requirements-dev.txt
